  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ORTHOPEDIC AIDS AND PHYSICAL THERAPY</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to provide the orthopedic and physical therapy aids that the patient requires, to facilitate their mobilization, and give them the necessary care according to the indicated medical prescription once they have undergone surgery. Some patients have had to be amputated in some of their lower or upper limbs due to cancer and therefore require special assistance.</narrative>
